    title: "The Challenge of.... NEXAR",
    description: Some("A crosshair shooter set inside a space warp of ninety-nine levels: on each one you must blast every radioactive beacon before the clock empties, while the impact-exploding saucers guarding them close in. The crosshair marks your own position, so standing still means collision — each one costs a shield, and the difficulty switches set whether you carry three or five and what running out of time forfeits."),
